" wanderlan  1 Overview  2 Sites  3 VLANs  4 MACs  5 Log  6 Setup  7 Settings    "
"┌ Setup: Welcome ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│                                                                              │"
"│ wanderlan connects sites on layer 2 like one big switch: VLANs pass between  │"
"│ all sites, and per site you choose which VLANs take part, map VLAN IDs and   │"
"│ put untagged traffic into a VLAN. It does not build a VPN: the sites must    │"
"│ already reach each other through an existing transport network (usually a    │"
"│ VPN).                                                                        │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│   > Start a new network         this is the first site                       │"
"│     Join an existing network    with an invitation code from any site        │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│ Up/Down to choose, Enter to start, Esc to leave the setup.                   │"
"│                                                                              │"
